---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="site-title">
  <h1 id="site-title">{{ site.title }}</h1>
  <p>我关注模型如何生成和操作界面，以及如何评测和训练这些能力。</p>
</section>
<div class="index-grid">
  <section class="article-index" id="articles" aria-labelledby="articles-title">
    <h2 id="articles-title">文章</h2>
    {% if collections.posts.length %}
      <ol class="article-list">
        {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
          <li>
            <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | shortDate }}</time>
            <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title | escape }}</a></h3>
            {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    {% else %}
      <p class="empty">暂无文章。可以通过 <a href="/feed.xml">RSS</a> 订阅后续更新。</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
  <aside class="topics" aria-labelledby="topics-title">
    <h2 id="topics-title">研究方向</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>GUI Agent</li>
      <li>UI 生成与美学评估</li>
      <li>大模型评测与后训练</li>
      <li>Agentic RL</li>
    </ul>
  </aside>
</div>
